Translation patch: <spqr::chain::Chain>::into_pb

Change: `self.links.into_iter().map(..).collect::<Vec<_>>()` becomes a loop that pops the links
from the front of the `VecDeque` and pushes the converted epochs into a `Vec`.
Why: `map`/`collect` are not modelled by the Aeneas Lean library (aeneas#1043).
Behaviour: identical (same elements, same order).
Relies on: `self.dir.into()` (prost enum to `i32`) and `ChainEpochDirection::into_pb` (moves the
fields) are pure, so converting the links before `direction` is unobservable.

